    "description": "<p><strong>Range:</strong> 10 spaces</p><p>You devour the life-energy of a creature, using it to revitalize yourself.</p><p>Choose yourself or an ally within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. Until the start of your next turn, whenever the target kills a creature, it regains <strong>Stamina</strong> equal to half the victim's total <strong>Stamina</strong> (minimum <strong>1</strong>).</p><p>If the target damages a swarm, they recover <strong>Stamina</strong> equal to the <strong>Damage</strong> dealt.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.uuFxRsNX4gWQLq45]{Kirin's Feast}</p>",
